---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural Finance & Farm Funding | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Agricultural loans, insurance, input finance, equipment finance and leasing resources for African farmers and agribusinesses.
permalink: "/agricultural-finance/"
---
{% set listings = directoryListings.listings | default([]) %}
{% set finance = listings | selectattr("type","equalto","finance") | selectattr("active","equalto",true) | list %}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;"><div class="container" style="max-width:1000px;">
<span class="eyebrow">Funding Directory</span><h1>Agricultural Finance</h1>
<p class="lede">Explore finance providers and agricultural funding routes. Published listings can include eligibility, application information and verification dates.</p>
{% if finance | length %}<div style="display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:28px;">{% for item in finance %}{% if item.verification_status != "closed" and item.verification_status != "expired" %}<article style="padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><h2 style="margin-top:0;">{{ item.title }}</h2><p><strong>{{ item.country }}</strong>{% if item.region %} · {{ item.region }}{% endif %}</p>{% if item.finance_type %}<p><strong>Finance type:</strong> {{ item.finance_type | replace("_"," ") }}</p>{% endif %}{% if item.finance_amount %}<p><strong>Amount / range:</strong> {{ item.finance_amount }}</p>{% endif %}<p>{{ item.description }}</p>{% if item.eligibility %}<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> {{ item.eligibility }}</p>{% endif %}{% if item.application_url %}<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ item.application_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Application / Official Page</a>{% elif item.url %}<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official Website</a>{% endif %}</article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div style="margin-top:28px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><h2>No verified finance listings are published yet</h2><p>We are building this directory around official sources rather than publishing unverified loan adverts. Verified providers and programmes can be added through the CMS.</p></div>{% endif %}
<p style="margin-top:28px;"><a href="/agriculture-resources/">← Back to Agricultural Resources</a></p></div></section>
